WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.136 --> 00:00:19.578
Do you love bike riding? I do.

2
00:00:19.579 --> 00:00:22.927
I ride my bike every day.

3
00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:26.623
It's important to take care of your bike.

4
00:00:26.624 --> 00:00:28.990
I'll show you how!

5
00:00:28.991 --> 00:00:33.141
First, always check your bike's tires.

6
00:00:33.142 --> 00:00:46.821
You don't want to get a flat tire!

7
00:00:46.822 --> 00:00:55.574
So make sure your tires have enough air.

8
00:00:55.575 --> 00:01:00.071
This will protect the wheels too.

9
00:01:00.072 --> 00:01:04.229
Second, oil the chain sometimes.

10
00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:08.874
This helps your chain last a long time.

11
00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:12.345
Get some bicycle oil.

12
00:01:12.346 --> 00:01:15.868
Turn one pedal with your hand.

13
00:01:15.869 --> 00:01:23.893
At the same time, drop oil on the chain.

14
00:01:23.894 --> 00:01:29.258
All you need is a few drops!

15
00:01:29.259 --> 00:01:35.515
Third, keep your bike dry.

16
00:01:35.516 --> 00:01:43.669
Rain will make the metal parts rust.

17
00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:48.312
Keep your bike inside.

18
00:01:48.313 --> 00:01:55.436
If you must store it outside, get a cover for it.

19
00:01:55.437 --> 00:01:59.572
Sometimes your bike will get wet or muddy.

20
00:01:59.573 --> 00:02:08.446
Just wipe it as soon as you can.

21
00:02:08.447 --> 00:02:13.125
Fourth, take your bike to a shop once a year.

22
00:02:13.126 --> 00:02:16.089
An expert can check your bike.

23
00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:20.350
Then you will know it's safe to ride.

24
00:02:20.351 --> 00:02:24.312
It's like seeing the doctor!

25
00:02:24.313 --> 00:02:27.934
Oh, there's one more thing.

26
00:02:27.935 --> 00:02:31.485
Check your seat height before you ride.

27
00:02:31.486 --> 00:02:33.370
Sit on the seat.

28
00:02:33.371 --> 00:02:37.836
Your feet should touch the ground.

29
00:02:37.837 --> 00:02:43.418
As you grow, you will need to raise the seat.

30
00:02:43.419 --> 00:02:48.018
I already raised mine twice!

31
00:02:48.019 --> 00:02:52.678
My bike looks great.

32
00:02:52.679 --> 00:02:56.478
I'm ready to ride now.

33
00:02:56.479 --> 00:03:00.486
There's a new bike path in the park.

34
00:03:00.487 --> 00:03:16.454
I can't wait to try it!
